        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is most certainly a Neovim upstream issue: neovim/neovim#42292. It just gets more visible with 'mini.clue' here since there is a time for progress message to print something during `vim.fn.getcharstr()` is active.\n\nThat said, there is a way to make a small refactor for a cleaner state tracking (basically save `vim.v.count` as early as possible) that will make this work as well.",
